From 607d1bdce3caac2637a8f780e0484dc83c5aeb72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 14:23:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD selected-agent slash command dispatch so backend
 commands bypass prompt sends

Route slash-prefixed selected-agent messages through a provider-neutral backend command hook. Codex implements the hook with app-server slash actions, while ordinary prompts continue through the turn path so slash commands avoid prompt-policy injection and orchestrator follow-up processing.
